@startuml
title ATM Control - Combined Scenarios

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Waiting for PIN" as WaitingForPIN
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state "Waiting for Customer Choice" as WaitingForChoice
state Confiscating
state Ejecting
state ProcessingTransaction
state PrintingReceipt
state DispensingCash
state ClosedDown
state FinalState

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt

ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Invalid PIN Too Many Times / Security Reason
Confiscating --> Ejecting : Card Ejected

WaitingForPIN --> WaitingForChoice : Correct PIN / Display Options
WaitingForChoice --> ProcessingTransaction : Choice Made / Process Request
ProcessingTransaction --> PrintingReceipt : Approved Transaction / Print Receipt
PrintingReceipt --> DispensingCash : Cash Needed / Dispense Cash
DispensingCash --> Ejecting : Card Ejected

ProcessingTransaction --> ClosedDown : Rejected Request / Display System Down
Ejecting --> Idle : Card Ejected / Return to Waiting State

FinalState <-- [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
